 Vi editor (vim- vi modified)
 
 How to create a file in vi editor?
 
 command: vi <file-name>
 
 Note:
 
 1. if file exist then it will open the file when you execute vi <file-name>
 2. If file dosn't exist it will create a file and open the file
 
 .............................................................
 
 Vi editor modes
 
 1. Command mode
 2. Insert mode
 
 Whenever you execute vi <file-name> it will open the file and by default 
 it will be in the command mode 
 
 To switch from command mode to insert mode we need to use i (insert)
 
